      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    add_on_rate = 0.065\n    days_to_maturity = 150\n    money_market_year = 360\n    bond_equivalent_year = 365\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    holding_period_rate = add_on_rate * days_to_maturity / money_market_year\n    purchase_price_fraction = 1 - holding_period_rate\n    bond_equivalent_yield = (\n        holding_period_rate\n        / purchase_price_fraction\n        * bond_equivalent_year\n        / days_to_maturity\n        * 100\n    )\n\n    # return answer\n    return round(bond_equivalent_yield, 2)\n```",
